[A Shaman] At [TAR523 Thor], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Thelsamar]|r (the game routes it through Stormwind and Ironforge) [G56.5,52.6 Westfall]
[A Shaman] Run up the west road to the north end of the loch (about 4 minutes) and at [TAR258043 Norric Lochthane], [QT94505] - the fixed reward is the |cff66ff66Water Totem|r [G41.7,19.3 Loch Modan]
[A Shaman] Back at [TAR1572 Thorgrum Borrelson], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Menethil Harbor]|r [G33.9,51 Loch Modan]

