[OC]|cffffcc00Check:|r handed in here: Seeking Caitlin (95737), The Absent Minded Prospector (942, 943), Lost in the Thicket Things (95647), Songblade Search (95772), Horrors in the Highland (95646), Highland Hides (98815), Heartwoven (95809) and, if they came your way, Lost Relic Carry (95810), Gleaning Our Future (98310) and, shaman, Call of Water (94500, 94501, 94502, 94503, 94505 - Water Totem in the bag). Carried on: Blessed Arm (322) and Fallen in the Fen (95795) for Stormwind and Lakeshire in chapter 25, For Further Study (98313) and, with the relic, Prehistoric Prism (98824) for Ironforge in chapter 24. Hearth = Sentinel Hill. Level-30 spells: the shaman trained in Ironforge above, the hunter waits for Ironforge in chapter 24. Next: Southshore
